; Knows about bytes, pointers, PTX strings and kernel handles, and takes
; Value / Dtype / Shape from cudacaml_ir for host copies; never about Graph
; or Kernel_ir. Wraps cudajit (driver API + NVRTC). Device.available ()
; is false without a GPU, and every GPU-dependent test skips itself on it,
; so the rest of the project still builds and tests on such a machine.
(library
 (name cudacaml_runtime)
 (public_name cudacaml.runtime)
 ; [ctypes] and [ctypes.foreign] are for lib/runtime/pinned.ml, which binds
 ; cuMemHostAlloc / cuMemFreeHost by hand: cudajit 0.7 does not expose them.
 ; Both already come in with cudajit, so this adds no opam dependency.
 (libraries cudacaml_ir cudajit.cuda cudajit.nvrtc ctypes ctypes.foreign))
